SUMMARY:TDRR #11 Weekday Morning Ride\, Hammer Creek Short (21F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Cindy Herr\n\nCele
 brate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to the
  event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Riding 
 our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose Page]
 (https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR Sched
 ule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-hammer-creek-short-21f/)\n\nTour de Red Rose & L
 BC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and W
 eather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/
 lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets a
 re mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic rep
 air kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetup 
 Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is you
 r agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.
 clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) a
 nd [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lan
 casterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
