 all cyclists. Good pace for beginners and families.\n\n Cue and Ride wit
 h GPS links: [LP Fox Meadows Ice Cream Ride (10R) - Lancaster Bike Club](h
 ttps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lp-fox-meadows-ice-cream-ride-10r/
 )\n\n Helmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottle
 s\, and basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n
