SUMMARY:Birthday Ride
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Kirsten Madd
 en\nSweep: open\n\nThis birthday ride captures the miles for the many birt
 hdays we've missed this past winter and spring and especially celebrates o
 ur host's big 60th birthday today! It combines two routes--the Tour #12 mo
 rning Martindale 1/4 century and a revised version of the BV Mount Airy ri
 de that keeps us off of busy roads. Click here for the link to the route:\
 n\n* [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/56114209](https://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/56114209)\n\nPlease be sure to sign up here as well as for the TdRR ri
 de so that you get the ride credit.\n\nNote that we are starting at 7 AM\,
  not 8 AM as posted on the TdRR ride. Hopefully\, we can avoid some of the
  heat.\n\nThis is a 66-mile ride\, so be sure to bring lots of water and s
 nacks! We will stop periodically to regroup and refuel. We have two refuel
 ing options: we stop back at the Brownstown parking lot between the two ri
 des--have extra water and food in your car. And then we will also stop at 
 Molly's Convenience store at mile 40. We will likely grab lunch somewhere 
 nearby after the ride.\n\nA big thanks to Phil Newswanger for creating the
  revised route!\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes
  and Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!
 forum/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHel
 mets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and bas
 ic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a M
 eetup Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.
 lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP 
 is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbik
 eclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323
 984) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.
 aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https
 ://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3155211
 68/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T212951Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T212951Z
