DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n25-ish mile flat *rolling
 * route.\nThe route is the same each week.\n\nFor the experienced group ri
 der in good physical condition and capable of maintaining a steady pace. F
 ew stops if any. Riders unable to maintain classified pace may be dropped.
  If unsure if this ride is for you\, it is recommended you try the "A" rid
 e option first\, which leaves from the same location a few minutes later.\
 n\nCue sheet and GPX files: [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42866619](http
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/42866619)\n\n\\*occasionally\, additional miles
  are added mid-loop. Please note the start location is NOT Landis Valley M
 useum.\n\nShow & Go (please bring a cue if you are not familiar with the r
 oute).\nNo Leader (means that this ride will not be cancelled due to weath
 er).\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devic
 es. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\
 , pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waive
 r\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ri
 de. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do
  not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy
 \; only club members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean y
 ou are a club member. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide 
 by the club's Code of Conduct: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.c
 lubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nR
 ules of the Road: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_
 id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.co
 m/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\nand\nRide Waiv
